Package: cudaverseCUDA
Title: Native CUDA Backend Extension for Cudaverse
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Yaoxiang", "Li", email = "liyaoxiang@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an optional lightweight native CUDA backend for the
    'cudaverse' package. The extension dynamically discovers the NVIDIA CUDA
    Driver and cuBLAS libraries at runtime and implements device diagnostics,
    allocation, host-device transfer, synchronization, and dense matrix
    multiplication without linking to 'LibTorch' or requiring a CUDA Toolkit
    during package installation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/cudaverse/cudaverseCUDA
BugReports: https://github.com/cudaverse/cudaverseCUDA/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
SystemRequirements: NVIDIA CUDA driver; NVIDIA cuBLAS 12 at runtime for matrix multiplication
Imports:
    cudaverse (>= 0.2.0.9000)
Remotes:
    cudaverse/cudaverse@develop/native-cuda
